0. Web edition (kawaiyui233)
----------------------------

This repository is a modified Web edition of dsh-usage-stats, originally
published at https://github.com/Jockjrop/dsh-usage-stats
(package @sligqoer/dsh-usage-stats, version 0.2.5, Apache-2.0).

Modifications by kawaiyui233, version 1.0.0-web.1: the desktop-profile mount
gate was removed from cordis.patch.yml and src/index.js, and the renderer's
Electron preload-bridge (window.dshDesktop) requirement was removed from
src/client.js, so the plugin mounts on the DSH Web profile. The package was
renamed to @kawaiyui233/dsh-usage-stats and documentation, locales and tests
were updated to match. Upstream copyright and licence terms are unchanged;
see LICENSE and the original project for full attribution.

